== Trivia ==
* This is a reference to the ''[[wikipedia:Super Mario|Super Mario]]'' franchise, wherein collecting a green mushroom would give the player an extra life.
* 1up!, along with {{i|Magic Mushroom}}, {{i|Mini Mush}}, {{i|Super Bandage}}, and {{i|Mega Mush}} is one of the few items that make a unique sound upon pickup.

